description_en:
After many requests from our Argentinian users, today I bring you the first version of this incredible mod! An edition that combines European and Argentinian teams, known as Euro-Argento! Focused on the South American audience who speak Spanish and also want to play with their country's teams, just like we play Bomba Patch here which is focused on the Brazilian league, they also want to have fun with the clubs from the Argentinian league.

It was difficult to find, but we searched a lot and managed to find a Spanish-language football mod with the updated LPF (Liga Profesional de Fútbol) league along with European clubs for the Argentinian audience! I know you all really like our app, and this Argentinian community has been growing a lot lately. Although it's very rare to find mods like Bomba Patch for us Brazilians, we managed to find this one for you, which I imagine follows the same pattern, but with the LPF league that you all asked for so much. I hope you like it and complain less in the comments in all the games haha!

This version corresponds to the start of the season, therefore it includes some elements from 2026, although not all.

🌟MOD FEATURES

✔️Efootball PES 26 Style
✔️Spanish Commentary
✔️Updated European Leagues
✔️LPF and HD League Minikits
✔️Optimized Textures
✔️PS4 Wide Camera
✔️Stable Performance

